  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fed Ombudsmen V Kladusa</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Fed Ombudsm&#xE4;n V Kladusa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">De Federala Ombudsm&#xE4;nnen i BiH etablerades efter Washingtonavtalet mellan de muslimska och kroatiska styrkorna i Bosnien (1995). De tar hand om klagom&#xE5;l r&#xF6;rande diskriminering och framf&#xF6;r allt kring egendomsfr&#xE5;gor d&#xE5; den s&#xF6;kande inte f&#xE5;tt en r&#xE4;ttvis behandling. St&#xF6;det r&#xF6;r deras f&#xE4;ltkontor i Velika Kladusa (Una-Sana-kantonen)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Federal Ombudsmen in BiH were established after the Washington Agreement between Muslim and Croat forces in BiH (1995). They deal with complaints regarding discrimination and primarily regarding property issues, when the plaintiff has not received a fair  treatment. The support is for their Field Office in Velika Kladusa.</narrative>
  </description>
